{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/extras/4f34d5538a51fdf703aabbfc93c2c9a0.avif?t=1756838127\" width=616 height=175 /></span>Prepare yourself for an epic adventure in CannonHead, a third-person action shooter game that balances intense combat and immersive exploration. Inspired by children's animations from the 1920s and 1930s, CannonHead uses techniques that translate the vintage effects of 2D animations into a 3D environment, maintaining all the charm and nostalgic fun of the classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of unique worlds and environments, recruit valuable companions for your journey, and discover new weapons and equipment to help you face increasingly powerful enemies. All while trying to escape from your old boss, who wasn't too happy with your peculiar way of resigning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this fantastic journey and see if you have what it takes to overcome challenges and protect your allies in CannonHead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/extras/1e3f7947c9ba61dc43f76cff0fd4abf9.poster.avif?t=1756838127\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/extras/1e3f7947c9ba61dc43f76cff0fd4abf9.webm?t=1756838127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/extras/1e3f7947c9ba61dc43f76cff0fd4abf9.mp4?t=1756838127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced Combat and Exploration: </strong>Frenetic action and immersive exploration in one package.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style:</strong> Innovative techniques that bring the charm of 1920s and 1930s animations to the 3D world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Worlds and Environments: </strong>Travel through various unique and wonderfully detailed settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Companions: </strong>Recruit allies to help you in your mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Arsenal:</strong> Find and utilize a wide range of weapons and equipment.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3320440?t=1756838127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756838127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/40ab2b0f5e2f8d7b5eee5c598bac66ab09edd3cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756838127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/40ab2b0f5e2f8d7b5eee5c598bac66ab09edd3cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756838127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320440/extras/4f34d5538a51fdf703aabbfc93c2c9a0.avif?t=1756838127\" width=616 height=175 /></span>Prepare yourself for an epic adventure in CannonHead, a third-person action shooter game that balances intense combat and immersive exploration. Inspired by children's animations from the 1920s and 1930s, CannonHead uses techniques that translate the vintage effects